{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22657","headline":"宴周皓大夫光福宅 · 白居易","name":"宴周皓大夫光福宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处风光最可怜？妓堂阶下砌台前。\n轩车拥路光照地，丝管入门声沸天。\n绿蕙不香饶桂酒，红樱无色让花钿。\n野人不敢求他事，唯借泉声伴醉眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}